BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:I Love Boosters
DTSTART:20260604T233000Z
DTEND:20260605T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260604T233000Z
UID:9ntqD90NMk
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nA crew of professional shoplifte
 rs take aim at a cutthroat fashion maven. It’s like community service.\n
 \nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/ilb\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Power Ballad
DTSTART:20260605T023000Z
DTEND:20260605T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20260605T023000Z
UID:BxAKwooVep
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 108 mins (1h48m)\n\nWhen Rick (Paul Rudd)\, a past-h
 is-prime wedding singer\, meets fading boy-band star Danny (Nick Jonas) du
 ring a gig\, the two bond over music and a late-night jam session. But whe
 n Danny turns one of Rick's songs into the hit that reignites his career\,
  Rick sets out to reclaim the recognition he believes he deserves—even i
 f it means risking everything he cares about. From writer-director John Ca
 rney (Sing Street\, Once)\, Power Ballad is a feel-good story about music\
 , self-respect\, friendship\, and the price of ambition.\n\nhttps://www.si
 ff.net/cinema/in-theaters/power-ballad-yr\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
